      "writtenOn": "2025-10-27T21:12:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a correct call.\n\n* After `Seek(0)`, `ReadMoreData` would think that the data present in `codec_memory_` still needs to be fed into the decoder.  So, `PngReadMoreData` would first feed old/stale `codec_memory_`, and then it would start feeding `file_` data starting at `offset_` 0.\n\n* After `Seek(...GetSize())`, `ReadMoreData` sees that `codec_memory_` is empty and needs to be populated with new data (read from `file_` starting at `offset_` 0).\n\nLet me try improving the comment here.  Done?",
      "parentUuid": "45cef3c5_5b81c796",
